{
"#name"
:
{
"find"
:
null
,
"cn"
:
"为 AI agent 设计的增强 find"
,
"en"
:
"Enhanced find designed for AI agents"
}
,
"#synopsis"
:
[
{
"x find [extension-args] [--] [path] [find-expr]"
:
null
}
,
{
"x find . -name \"*.ts\""
:
null
}
,
{
"x find -i vendor . -name \"*.go\""
:
null
}
,
{
"x find --no-ignore . -type f"
:
null
}
]
,
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"用 shell 脚本对系统 find 的轻量增强，100% 兼容原生 find 接口，为 AI agent 自动排除噪音目录以减少误报、节省 token 和上下文、加速搜索"
,
"en"
:
"Lightweight shell wrapper around system find, 100% compatible with native find interface, auto-excludes noise dirs to reduce false positives, save tokens and context, and speed up search for AI agents"
}
,
"-i|--ignore"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"添加自定义忽略目录名（可叠加使用）"
,
"en"
:
"Add custom ignore directory name (can be stacked)"
}
,
"#1"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"忽略的目录名"
,
"en"
:
"Directory name to ignore"
}
}
}
,
"--no-ignore"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"禁用默认忽略规则"
,
"en"
:
"Disable default ignore rules"
}
}
,
"--no-homeignore"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"禁用 $HOME 目录下的额外忽略规则"
,
"en"
:
"Disable extra ignore rules for $HOME directory"
}
}
,
"--prune-hidden"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"排除隐藏目录（. 开头），默认不排除隐藏目录"
,
"en"
:
"Prune hidden directories (dot-prefixed), off by default"
}
}
,
"--verbose|-v"
:
{
"#desc"
:
{
"cn"
:
"显示当前生效的忽略列表"
,
"en"
:
"Show active ignore lists"
}
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"Two categories of arguments: x find extension args (before --) and raw find args (after --).\nExtension args: -i, --no-ignore, --no-homeignore, --verbose\nFind args: path, -name, -type, -exec, -maxdepth, and all standard find expressions\n"
,
"cn"
:
"参数分两类：x find 增强参数（-- 之前）和 find 原参数（-- 之后）。\n增强参数: -i, --no-ignore, --no-homeignore, --verbose\nfind 原参数: path, -name, -type, -exec, -maxdepth 及所有标准 find 表达式\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Default excludes (-name, any depth): .git, .svn, .hg, node_modules, __pycache__, .venv, .gradle, .mvn, .build, .cache, .tmp, .DS_Store\nThese are tool-generated directories that are never business files.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"默认排除（-name，任意深度）: .git, .svn, .hg, node_modules, __pycache__, .venv, .gradle, .mvn, .build, .cache, .tmp, .DS_Store\n均为工具生成的目录，不包含业务文件。\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Default ignore rules exist to filter out auto-generated files from libraries, plugins, and dev tools — these are not user files. If you need to search inside them, target the directory directly: `find ~/.vim` or `x find --no-ignore -i .git -- ~/.vim`\n"
,
"cn"
:
"默认过滤的目的是排除由库、插件、开发工具自动生成的外部代码文件，这些一般不是用户文件。如果需要对这些目录进行搜索，可以直接指定目录：`find ~/.vim` 或 `x find --no-ignore -i .git -- ~/.vim`\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"$HOME extra excludes (-path, only direct children of $HOME):\n  darwin: Applications, Library, .Trash, .localized, Desktop, Documents, Pictures, Movies, Music, Public\n  linux: .dbus, .pki\n  win: AppData, Application Data\n  Common: .x-cmd.root, .codex, .agent, .crush, .cursor, .docker, .claude, .cargo, .bun, .cherrystudio, .npm, .yarn, .pnpm-store, .nvm, .node-gyp, .volta, .deno, .rustup, .pyenv, .conda, .sdkman, .rbenv, .jenv, .n, .config, .local, .vscode, .vscode-server, .vscode-shared, .gradle, .m2, .sbt, .ivy2, .terraform.d, .minikube, .kube, .helm, .ipython, .jupyter, .pandoc, .vim, .oh-my-zsh, .tmux, .emacs.d, .android, .flutter, .electron-gyp, .gnupg, .pixi, .nix-profile, .nix-defexpr, .nix-channels, .xargo, .swiftpm, .copilot, .gemini, .trae, .cline, .cagent, .kimi, .warp, .agent-browser, .thumbnails, .sandboxd\n"
,
"cn"
:
"$HOME 额外排除（-path，仅匹配 $HOME 直接子目录）:\n  darwin: Applications, Library, .Trash, .localized, Desktop, Documents, Pictures, Movies, Music, Public\n  linux: .dbus, .pki\n  win: AppData, Application Data\n  通用: .x-cmd.root, .codex, .agent, .crush, .cursor, .docker, .claude, .cargo, .bun, .cherrystudio, .npm, .yarn, .pnpm-store, .nvm, .node-gyp, .volta, .deno, .rustup, .pyenv, .conda, .sdkman, .rbenv, .jenv, .n, .config, .local, .vscode, .vscode-server, .vscode-shared, .gradle, .m2, .sbt, .ivy2, .terraform.d, .minikube, .kube, .helm, .ipython, .jupyter, .pandoc, .vim, .oh-my-zsh, .tmux, .emacs.d, .android, .flutter, .electron-gyp, .gnupg, .pixi, .nix-profile, .nix-defexpr, .nix-channels, .xargo, .swiftpm, .copilot, .gemini, .trae, .cline, .cagent, .kimi, .warp, .agent-browser, .thumbnails, .sandboxd\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"For git projects, prefer git ls-files and git grep for faster indexed search. For system-wide search, use mdfind (macOS), locate (Linux) or similar indexed tools. Run `x skill0 find-better` to learn more about find/bfind, mdfind, git ls-files, git grep, locate and other file search best practices.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"在 git 项目中，优先使用 git ls-files 和 git grep 进行更高效的索引搜索。全局搜索可使用 mdfind (macOS)、locate (Linux) 等系统级索引工具。运行 `x skill0 find-better` 了解 find/bfind、mdfind、git ls-files、git grep、locate 等文件搜索最佳实践。\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Common -i values for project-specific exclusions: vendor, target, dist, build, out, venv, Pods, DerivedData\n"
,
"cn"
:
"常用 -i 值（按需排除）: vendor, target, dist, build, out, venv, Pods, DerivedData\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Use `x bfind` for BFS (breadth-first) search — shares the same ignore rules as `x find`, but results are sorted by depth (shallow first). Ideal for exploring unfamiliar directories layer by layer, getting a broad overview before going deep. Default depth is 3, adjustable with `--bfs-maxdepth`.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"使用 `x bfind` 进行 BFS（广度优先）搜索 — 与 `x find` 共享同一套忽略规则，但结果按深度排序（浅层优先）。适合逐层递进地探索陌生目录，先看全貌再深入。默认搜索 3 层，可用 `--bfs-maxdepth` 调整。\n"
}
,
{
"en"
:
"Security: ignore name quoting via `___x_cmd_shq1_` (shell-style single-quote escape) prevents command injection via `-i`. See [x-bash/xrc#34](https://github.com/x-bash/xrc/issues/34) for safety verification.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"安全：使用 `___x_cmd_shq1_`（shell-style single-quote 转义）对 ignore 名加引号，防止通过 `-i` 注入命令。安全验证见 [x-bash/xrc#34](https://github.com/x-bash/xrc/issues/34)。\n"
}
]
,
"#tldr"
:
[
{
"cmd"
:
"x find . -name \"*.ts\""
,
"cn"
:
"Example: 搜索 .ts 文件（自动排除噪音目录）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Search .ts files (auto-excludes noise dirs)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x find --ignore vendor --ignore target -- . -name \"*.go\""
,
"cn"
:
"Example: Go 项目排除 vendor 和 target"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Go project, exclude vendor and target"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x find --ignore node_modules -- . -maxdepth 3 -name \"*.yml\""
,
"cn"
:
"Example: 限制搜索深度，查找配置文件"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Limit search depth, find config files"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x find . -type f -name \"*.log\" -mtime +7"
,
"cn"
:
"Example: 查找 7 天前的旧日志文件"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Find log files older than 7 days"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x find --no-ignore --ignore node_modules -- . -name \"*.ts\""
,
"cn"
:
"Example: 清空默认排除，只忽略自定义目录"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Clear defaults, only ignore custom dirs"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x find --no-ignore --no-homeignore -- . -type d"
,
"cn"
:
"Example: 禁用所有忽略规则，等同原生 find"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Disable all ignore rules, same as raw find"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x find . -type f -executable"
,
"cn"
:
"Example: 查找可执行文件（使用 -- 可显式分隔增强参数与 find 参数，可选）"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Find executable files (use -- to explicitly separate extension and find args, optional)"
}
,
{
"cmd"
:
"x find . -name \"*.tmp\" -delete"
,
"cn"
:
"Example: 删除所有临时文件"
,
"en"
:
"Example: Delete all temporary files"
}
]
}

